    <string name="partial_bit_search_limit_note">Shared limit per RS block for partial-bit search and the remaining degrees of freedom after solving RS constraints. Default: 12 bits. Each extra bit doubles the maximum enumeration count; combining this with * search increases the workload further. Memory limits may stop the search before this limit is reached.</string>
